From 39a5d4e6a3b3c1abc79bf93de7bd37f3d93593bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:54:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0217: ease imported Digimon field animation transitions

Blend ordinary field rest, walk, fatigue and run poses for imported partners and NPCs over four logic ticks using render-only quaternion interpolation and mesh support height. Restore draw matrices and preserve source animation, events and navigation. Handle interruptions, hidden parts, 34-bone models and map/entity lifecycle.

Validation: ASan/UBSan host harness; 175-model production-math geometry audit (7350 transition cases); bilingual build and ISO identities; WarGreymon native-pad A/B and scoped NeoCrimson34 runtime supplement on the patch0215-based test image. The six animation source files are identical on difficulty0216.
